      "body": "User:5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d I have a question about Variation Group. Many of our accessories do not have sizes but they come in different colours (in some cases) or sometimes it is just the one colour. Should Variation Group be purchasable in this scenario? As there is no size combination to make it a Variant (SKU).",
