      "body": "User:712020:4ec4770e-9470-4885-9753-69a36b6cf950 Hi Dani, in that scenario - we would still have the size variant SKU - but it’ll just be 1 Size Variant. \n\nDo they have the same Stylecode - so they would share a master product level? \n\nDrawing out an example:\n\n1. Master: Earrings (Product id: ABC)\n  1. Colour Variant 1: Gold (Product id: ABCGold)\n    1. Size Variant: One Size (Product id: ABCGoldOneSize)\n  1. Colour Variant 2: Silver (Product id: ABCSilver)\n    1. Size Variant: One SizeColour Variant 1: Gold (stylecode: ABCSilverOneSize)",
