  "description": "**As a** Shopper, \n\n**I want** to save a product to my Wishlist from the PDP, \n\n**so that** I can keep track of items I love and return to purchase them later.\n\n----\n\n**Image for reference (Figma leading):** \n\n![\"image-20260805-073444.png\"](image-20260805-073444.png)\n\n\n\n- The wishlist icon is displayed on the PDP at all times. \n- If the customer clicks the wishlist icon without selecting a size first, they are prompted to select a size. \n- Once a size is selected, guest customers are shown the login/create account modal before the item is saved. \n      - The sign-in modal itself (authentication flow) is out of scope for this story — that is covered in the Wishlist epic.\n- Authenticated customers see the wishlist icon update to its active (selected) state immediately upon wishlisting. \n- Items are saved at size level per colour variant. Each colour variant of a product is treated independently, meaning the same size can be wishlisted across multiple colour variants. \n- Deselecting the wishlist icon on PDP removes the item from the wishlist.",
