=== PRD-062 + neighbours (pdp.md §14) ===
178:- **Pinch-to-zoom and swipe-to-advance** gallery navigation — mobile and touch (PRD-061, confirmed)
179:- Gallery updates to display variant images when a colour swatch is selected, without a full page reload (PRD-062, confirmed)
180:- Images served in optimised format at appropriate resolutions per device breakpoint (PRD-063, confirmed)
181:- Primary hero image **priority-loaded** (may vary per product — flatlay, model, or video) (PRD-064, confirmed)

=== PRD-004 swatch behaviour (§2) ===
19:- "Also available in" / "Only available in" colour swatches; selecting a colour updates the page content and URL (PRD-004, confirmed). Hover-to-preview swatch behaviour (colour updates on rollover without click) is a **custom build, not OOTB, and not scoped for go-live** — see Open Items (PRD-004)
219:- Colour swatch management and mapping — colour mapping exercise TBC (SPR-26, PRD-004)
220:- Swatch hover preview (colour updates on rollover without click) — custom build, not OOTB; pending decision to log as enhancement (PRD-004)

=== base swatch.jsx full render ===
 * The Swatch Component displays item inside `SwatchGroup`. For proper keyboard accessibility,
 * ensure that the rendered elements can receive keyboard focus, and are immediate siblings.
 */
const Swatch = ({
    children,
    disabled,
    href,
    label,
    name,
    selected,
    isFocusable,
    value,
    handleSelect,
    variant = 'square'
}) => {
    const styles = useMultiStyleConfig('SwatchGroup', {variant, disabled, selected})
    const isDesktop = useBreakpointValue({base: false, lg: true})
    const [selectHandlers, setSelectHandlers] = useState({})

    const onSelect = useCallback(
        (e) => {
            e.preventDefault()
            handleSelect(value)
        },
        [handleSelect]
    )

    useEffect(() => {
        if (!handleSelect) {
            return
        }

        setSelectHandlers({
            [isDesktop ? 'onMouseEnter' : 'onClick']: onSelect
        })
    }, [onSelect, isDesktop])

    return (
        <Button
            {...styles.swatch}
            as={href ? RouteLink : 'button'}
            to={href}
            aria-label={name}
            aria-checked={selected}
            variant="outline"
            role="radio"
            // To mimic the behavior of native radio inputs, only one input should be focusable.
            // (The rest are selectable via arrow keys.)
            tabIndex={isFocusable ? 0 : -1}
            {...(href ? {} : selectHandlers)}
        >
            <Center {...styles.swatchButton}>
                {children}
                {label && <Box>{label}</Box>}
            </Center>
        </Button>
    )
}

Swatch.displayName = 'Swatch'

