  "customfield_10231": {
    "value": "1. Given a customer is on the PDP and has not selected a size, when they click the wishlist icon, the size selector is highlighted with a prompt to select a size first.\n2. Given a customer has selected a size and is not logged in, when they click the wishlist icon, the sign-in/create account modal appears (covered in wishlist epic — can route to the out-of-the-box login page first).\n3. Given a customer has selected a size and is logged in, when they click the wishlist icon, the item is saved to their wishlist at the size level and the icon updates to its active state.\n4. Given a wishlisted item is displayed on the PDP with its size selected, when the customer clicks the active wishlist icon, the item is removed from the wishlist and the icon returns to its default state.\n5. Given a customer navigates to a PDP that was already wishlisted for that colour variant, when the page renders the wishlist icon displays in its active state and the customer cannot add another size of the same colour variant to the wishlist.\n6. Given a product has multiple colour variants, when the customer switches to a different colour on the PDP, the wishlist icon reflects that colour variant’s wishlist status independently — each colour variant can be on the wishlist independently (but one size per colour variant - does not have to be the same size).\n7. Given an out-of-stock size is selected, when the customer clicks the wishlist icon, the item can be added to the wishlist — both out-of-stock and in-stock sizes are eligible."
  },
